 "summary": "Nine single Schottky barrier rectifiers in the SMA (DO-214AC) surface-mount package, all rated 1.0 A average forward current and 30 A surge. They differ in reverse voltage, from 20 V (SS12) to 200 V (SS120); the SS115 blocks 150 V. Forward drop at 1 A rises with the voltage rating, from 0.55 V to 0.95 V maximum. Intended uses are fast switching, circuit protection and voltage clamping.",
